[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584316\">1088E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584299\">1088B20</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the air duct to the radiator.</p><p>2. Remove the air duct.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021025.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585261\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) on the duct, then withdraw the duct (1b)\nfrom the top of the car.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021241.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584819\">5040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585261\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Undo retaining bolts (1a) and disconnect both air conditoning\nsystem hoses (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021483.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the air duct is not damaged.</p><p>Fit the air duct on the radiator and secure\nit using the fixing bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584316\">1088E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584123\">0010T21</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the duct in its original seating\nand tighten the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585261\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the air duct to the radiator.</p><p>2. Remove the air duct.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021484.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the air duct and tighten the fixing\nbolts.</p><p>Connect the two air conditioning system\npipes .</p><p>Connect the upper and lower radiator pipes\nand secure them with the retaining band</p><p><a href=\"#/2585261\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584122\">0010T20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584819\">5040A10</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]